Model weights
-------------
This project downloads and runs the MuQ-MuLan model (OpenMuQ/MuQ-MuLan-large,
https://huggingface.co/OpenMuQ/MuQ-MuLan-large) at runtime through the `muq`
package and Hugging Face Hub.

